 The Lakeside Windsurf School teaches windsurfing on the lake from April to October, and rents boards and
 sails to its students and to visitors who bring their own experience. This repository holds the software
 of its booking desk, written in TypeScript with no runtime dependency.
+
+## Equipment rentals
+
+The `createRentalService()` API exported from `src/index.ts` provides an in-memory inventory and booking desk. Add boards or sails with a daily price in integer euro cents, then use `quote({ itemId, start, end })` to get the total or `book(...)` to reserve the equipment. Rental timestamps must be UTC ISO-8601 midnights. The end is exclusive and must be the midnight after the final rental day. A booking fails if that equipment is already booked during any part of the period. Each service instance starts with an empty inventory and booking list.
